WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.536
Video twenty-four. The office network: many
PCs, one set of books.

00:00:05.736 --> 00:00:09.755
One PC keeps the books. This PC is the office
server.

00:00:09.685 --> 00:00:13.235
The other PCs open the same books in Chrome or
Edge.

00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:16.583
Each person logs in with an own name and
password.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:23.200
On the server PC, in the Hisaab app for
Windows: F1, Settings, Data Folder and Server.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:28.879
Set "Other computers in the office open these
books" to Yes. The port is 9100.

00:00:28.809 --> 00:00:32.492
Below it, the form shows the address for the
other PCs.

00:00:32.692 --> 00:00:37.908
Ctrl+A saves it. Windows asks one time for a
firewall rule. Answer Yes.

00:00:37.838 --> 00:00:42.588
When Windows does not allow the rule, Hisaab
shows one command for an IT person.

00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:45.734
Then Hisaab starts again as the office server.

00:00:46.034 --> 00:00:50.117
Under the logo, the server PC now shows OFFICE
SERVER.

00:00:50.147 --> 00:00:54.230
F1, S, F opens Data Folder and Server.

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:58.860
It shows the address, and the fingerprint of
the certificate.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:08.110
Then a user for each person. Alt+K, Security: Control
User Access, Yes, and an owner password.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:14.227
Alt+C makes a user: Data Entry, the name, and
Allow Browser Access, Yes.

00:01:15.176 --> 00:01:18.926
Then a password for the user. Now priya is in
the list.

00:01:22.052 --> 00:01:28.402
On another PC, open Chrome or Edge with https,
the address of the server, and the port.

00:01:28.432 --> 00:01:35.050
The first time, Hisaab shows the fingerprint of the server.
Compare it with the server PC, then continue.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:39.032
Select the company, and log in with your own
name and password.

00:01:43.393 --> 00:01:47.676
Now priya works on the same books. This PC
shows MULTI USER.

00:01:48.427 --> 00:01:52.778
One PC keeps the books, and every PC in the
office works on them.

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:56.059
Next: screen languages and phonetic typing.

